{"id": 8575, "name": "Lakeview Park Campsite", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://lakecowichan.ca/camping.php", "lines": ["reservations for 2027 must be made online on our booking website . | | | Reserve Online If you experience problems with booking try clearing your history and or switching web browsers. Reservations | | RATES | A rate of $44 per site is in effect for each night with an additional fee of $14 per night for a powered site. Also, a non-refundable booking fee of $3.00 per reservation will added to each reservation. This fe", "g your history and or switching web browsers. Reservations | | RATES | A rate of $44 per site is in effect for each night with an additional fee of $14 per night for a powered site. Also, a non-refundable booking fee of $3.00 per reservation will added to each reservation. This fee is collected to cover the developer costs of the booking site for maintenance and improvements to the reservation system. | | Please refe", " will be required to reserve a minimum of three nights | | | Fees | | CAMPSITE FEE | The campsite fee is levied on a per party, per vehicle basis (see Camping Party Size definition). The campsite fee at Lakeview Park is $44.00 (including taxes), per camping party per site. At the time of reservation, payment of only one camping party per site is required. Any additional charges per site (e.g. extra vehicles) will be ", "quired. Any additional charges per site (e.g. extra vehicles) will be charged at arrival time. | POWER SITE SURCHARGE | Sites 2 through to 30 and from 35 through to 38 have power and water. There is an additional fee of $14.00 per day for each of these sites. | BOAT MOORAGE FEE | Very limited moorage space is available and will be available only on a first come first served basis. There is a $21.00 per day moorage fe", "wer and water. There is an additional fee of $14.00 per day for each of these sites. | BOAT MOORAGE FEE | Very limited moorage space is available and will be available only on a first come first served basis. There is a $21.00 per day moorage fee to tie up a boat at the Lakeview Campsite wharf. Moorage cannot be booked online but can be paid on arrival to the Campsite Attendant, on a first-come first-served basis, fo", "ced on the party size - the number of people and vehicles each campsite can accommodate. | In Lakeview Park, a camping party is defined as follows: | One to four persons 19 years of age or older. An additional charge of $15.00 per adult per night will be charged if more than 4 adults per site. | A maximum of eight persons including children (18 years of age and younger). | Vehicles per Camping Party: Only one vehicle", "e located 5 minutes from the campsite in Lake Cowichan. | Vehicles with boat trailers must park at the designated area on the upper parking site. | | Cancellation Policy | Please note that for any cancellation, a fee of $22.00 per site (plus the non-refundable booking fee) will be deducted from your refund for each confirmed reservation number. All refunds will be credited back to the credit card originally used to m"]}, {"url": "https://lakecowichan.ca/Taxes Utilities.php", "error": "InvalidURL(\"URL can't contain control characters. '/Taxes Utilities.php' (found at least ' ')\")"}, {"url": "https://lakecowichan.ca/public-works.php", "lines": [], "via": "Public Works & Engineering Services"}, {"url": "https://lakecowichan.ca/elections2026.php", "lines": ["please contact the Chief Election Officer . | Election Signage | Candidates must adhere to the Town of Lake Cowichan's signage bylaw when installing election signs. An application must be made and submitted along with a $100 refundable deposit . | Sign Regulation Amendment Bylaw (PDF) | Application for Election Sign Installation (PDF) | Election Bylaws | The Town of Lake Cowichan's election bylaw governs how the loca", "es. | The current election bylaw is Bylaw 1133-2026 — ELECTION and ASSENT VOTING BYLAW . | Campaign Financing | 2026 Candidate Expense Limits | Jurisdiction / Election Area Office Expense Limit | Lake Cowichan | Mayor | $12,323.78 | | Lake Cowichan | Councillor | $6,161.89 | | Lake Cowichan | Third Party Advertising | $924.28 | | Expense limits are established by Elections BC under the Local Elections Campaign Financ"], "via": "Election 2026 Overview"}, {"url": "https://lakecowichan.ca/reserve.campgroundreservations.com/search_sites?gs_campground_id=202322458", "error": "<HTTPError 404: 'Not Found'>"}]}
